WEBVTT

00:00:00.756 --> 00:00:02.015
Welcome to Nam Illam.

00:00:02.249 --> 00:00:03.657
A new day starts at home.

00:00:03.913 --> 00:00:05.023
Check what needs doing,

00:00:05.236 --> 00:00:06.367
see what’s in your pantry,

00:00:06.516 --> 00:00:07.796
and add what’s missing to your

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:08.692
shopping list.

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:10.015
Pick it up at the shop,

00:00:10.185 --> 00:00:11.330
then scan your receipt.

00:00:11.494 --> 00:00:13.329
Review and confirm to record your

00:00:13.371 --> 00:00:15.249
spending and update your pantry.

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.230
Your day,

00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:17.126
your shopping,

00:00:17.339 --> 00:00:19.430
your home—a little more together.

00:00:19.814 --> 00:00:20.752
Let’s get started.
